acceptance_criteria: "Latin, combining-mark, emoji and non-Latin fixtures account for every input code point; unsupported glyphs never silently disappear; one batch handles 100 labels and returns only failures by default; typed SDK and CLI return bounded TOON/JSON with refusals and remedies; packed install modes, non-git SDK model and public read-only tracker validation pass."
resolution: "Delivered by PR #26 (26d2090): Report unsupported font glyphs before rendering labels"
expected_result: "Latin, combining-mark, emoji and non-Latin fixtures account for every input code point; unsupported glyphs never silently disappear; one batch handles 100 labels and returns only failures by default; typed SDK and CLI return bounded TOON/JSON with refusals and remedies; packed install modes, non-git SDK model and public read-only tracker validation pass."
